### 20. Create Database Backup
# POST api/DatabaseBackup/CreateDatabaseBackup
# Protected by JWT Bearer Token
# Triggers SP_DatabaseBackup and generates SankysoftBillingDB_yyyyMMdd_HHmmss.bak in D:\Sankysoft\Backup\
POST {{Billing_Software_Api_HostAddress}}/api/DatabaseBackup/CreateDatabaseBackup
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

